2. The minimum requirements of the Karanj Seeds shall be,-
(a)
wholesome, mature, clean and dried;
(b)
of characteristic size, shape and colour,
(c)
free from living and dead insects, insect fragments, mites, larveae;
(d)
free from fungus infestation, mould growth;
(e)
free from added artificial colouring matter;
(f)
free from rodent hair and excreta;
(g)
free from the seeds of Argemone mexicana (Linn.), toxic seeds and other toxic weeds;
(h)
free from rancidity and mustiness;
(i)
the odour and flavour of the seeds when grind and moistened shall be fresh;
